_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 33, "score_up": 254, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVVekRYX", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 154, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8869929, "raw_content": "", "author": "Dindu_nufgins2", "created": 1791132078090, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "TrumpRideorDie74", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVVekRYX.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/s09bHR95xPDu.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/NdNkn0q84OtjGHfH.jpeg", "width": 300, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 350}], "blurhash": "U6Exqm?a0F4pJVM{^kxa05Ws}Rt6RRM|?u%2", "full_resolution": [350, 300]}, "title": "Any judge that uses anything other than the written law to make a ruling, the must be removed from the bench and disbared!", "last_comment_created": 1791153590513, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 8, "score_up": 154, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVVejteq", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 244, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8869758, "raw_content": "(to meet legal standards and many of those standards should be eliminated.)\n\nThere is a huge and growing boutique industry centered around classic vehicles that were exceptionally popular.  Most of these are either reconditions or totally new chassis and body panels paired w/ LS and sometimes Coyote engines.  These are generally highly equipped and very pricey.\n\nHowever, manufacturing true retro with limited options would be a huge profit center for the Big 3.\n\nBTW, you can actually buy a brand new WWII vintage Jeep body and source the parts to build yourself a brand new version of the aforementioned.\n\nEdit 2:  There are a few companies out there taking vintage vehicles and converting to electric.  Those were not included because that's just GAY!\n\nReturn to simplicity, at least for a single model or two.  Sales would be through the roof.\n\n\n\nEdit:\n\nhttps://anythingscout.com/pages/project-videos\n\nhttps://www.fj.co/\n\nhttps://www.classicfordbroncos.com/pages/build-a-bronco\n\nhttps://www.autoevolution.com/news/anyone-can-custom-order-a-stunning-and-brand-new-first-gen-bronco-here-s-how-270305.html\n\nhttps://www.velocityrestorations.com/restorations/1973-classic-ford-bronco-5090/\n\nhttps://squarebodyheadquarters.com/brand-new-squarebodys\n\nhttps://brandnewmusclecar.tv/models/\n\nThe following site is for the willis jeep in a crate, but it's a foreign website that may prompt warnings>>\n\nhttps://mdjuan.com.ph/product/kit-in-a-crate-mb/\n\n\n\nEdit 3:  Posted this thread a few days back regarding Ford Truck specifically>>\n\nhttps://patriots.win/p/1ATVQtVyS4/a-true-utility-truck--sub-40k--f/c", "author": "dataonly", "created": 1791122548590, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "2336retired", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The BIG 3 Should Start Manufacturing Retro Vehicles w/ As Few Options as Possible", "last_comment_created": 1791152177711, "content": "<p>(to meet legal standards and many of those standards should be eliminated.)</p>\n<p>There is a huge and growing boutique industry centered around classic vehicles that were exceptionally popular.  Most of these are either reconditions or totally new chassis and body panels paired w/ LS and sometimes Coyote engines.  These are generally highly equipped and very pricey.</p>\n<p>However, manufacturing true retro with limited options would be a huge profit center for the Big 3.</p>\n<p>BTW, you can actually buy a brand new WWII vintage Jeep body and source the parts to build yourself a brand new version of the aforementioned.</p>\n<p>Edit 2:  There are a few companies out there taking vintage vehicles and converting to electric.  Those were not included because that's just GAY!</p>\n<p>Return to simplicity, at least for a single model or two.  Sales would be through the roof.</p>\n<p>Edit:</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://anythingscout.com/pages/project-videos\" target=\"_blank\">https://anythingscout.com/pages/project-videos</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.fj.co/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.fj.co/</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.classicfordbroncos.com/pages/build-a-bronco\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.classicfordbroncos.com/pages/build-a-bronco</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.autoevolution.com/news/anyone-can-custom-order-a-stunning-and-brand-new-first-gen-bronco-here-s-how-270305.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.autoevolution.com/news/anyone-can-custom-order-a-stunning-and-brand-new-first-gen-bronco-here-s-how-270305.html</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.velocityrestorations.com/restorations/1973-classic-ford-bronco-5090/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.velocityrestorations.com/restorations/1973-cla